(2035.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.4 All suppliers must comply with the Responsible Business Alliance \(RBA\) Code of Conduct,) Tj T*
(including the prohibition of forced labour, child labour and excessive working hours above 60) Tj T*
(hours per week.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 5. Packaging and Circularity) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.1 By 2026 all consumer packaging must be at least 90 percent fibre-based and plastic-free,) Tj T*
(and 100 percent recyclable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.2 SKU-105 laptop stands use a minimum of 75 percent post-consumer recycled aluminium.) Tj T*
(Suppliers must provide chain-of-custody certificates for recycled content every quarter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.3 A product take-back programme covers SKU-102 monitors and SKU-104 battery packs, targeting) Tj T*
(a 40 percent collection rate by 2027.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 6. Inventory and Demand Planning) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.1 Demand forecasts are produced weekly using machine-learning models and must be reviewed by) Tj T*
(category planners before purchase orders are released.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.2 Safety stock is set at 1.65 standard deviations of forecast error over lead time, which) Tj T*
(corresponds to a 95 percent cycle service level.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.3 Over-production and excess inventory that results in write-offs above 2 percent of annual) Tj T*
(cost of goods sold must be escalated to the Sustainability Committee, because waste destroys) Tj T*
(embedded carbon.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 7. Governance and Reporting) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7.1 The Sustainability Committee of the Board reviews progress against these targets every) Tj T*
(quarter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7.2 ESG data is reported annually in line with the GRI Standards and the ISSB IFRS S2 climate) Tj T*
(disclosure standard, and is subject to limited assurance by an independent auditor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7.3 Breaches of this policy can be reported anonymously through the ethics hotline. Retaliation) Tj T*
(against whistle-blowers is strictly prohibited.) Tj T*
